# Text files are LF on every system. Several checks compare files byte for byte or by hash (THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, the format docs and their
# record in docs/FORMAT.sha256), and a Windows checkout with CRLF would fail them.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.wsnp binary
*.pdf binary
